DESCRIPTION:Merced Sunrise Rotary Club presents a community display of Amer
 ican flags honoring military service and first responders. Everyone is wel
 come to visit. Optional flag sponsorship and volunteer opportunities are a
 vailable through the organizer.\n\nCost: Free to visit\; optional flag spo
 nsorship is separate\n\nDisplay runs November 7–14\, 2026\, inclusive. D
 aily visitor hours are not published\; a date-only calendar block does not
  mean 24-hour public access.\n\nSource: Merced Sunrise Rotary Club / Colon
 ial Flag Foundation\nhttps://www.healingfield.org/event/merced-ca-field-of
 -honor/
LOCATION:Merced College\, 3600 M Street\, Merced\, CA 95348
CATEGORIES:Festivals & community
