DESCRIPTION:ESTEEM Youth & Family Resources hosts a public screening of Sou
 nd of Hope: The Story of Possum Trot\, with a community panel and discussi
 on about supporting children and families affected by foster care. Anyone 
 under 18 must attend with a parent or legal guardian. The organizer’s ti
 cket page marks online sales ended as of November 6. Check with the organi
 zer about any remaining availability\; capacity is limited.\n\nCost: Free\
 ; online reservations marked ended as of November 6. Check with the organi
 zer about availability.\n\nDoors open at 10 a.m. Panel 10:30–11 a.m.\; f
 ilm 11 a.m.–1:15 p.m.\; closing discussion 1:15–1:30 p.m.\n\nSource: E
 STEEM Youth & Family Resources — linked organizer registration page\nhtt
 ps://www.eventbrite.com/e/free-stand-sunday-movie-screening-merced-ca-on-n
 ovember-7th-tickets-2002835525973
